B.FH=new A.kz("Do I need public speaking experience?","No. We welcome people who are just starting. You do not need to feel confident before you join \u2014 the community is how confidence grows.")
B.FE=new A.kz("What if I'm extremely nervous?","Then you're in the right place. Nervousness is common here. We normalize it, understand it, and practice speaking through it \u2014 together.")
B.FF=new A.kz("Do I have to speak during my first session?","We'll explain what a typical session looks like when you reach out, and you can start at a pace that feels manageable. There is no pressure to perform.")
B.FG=new A.kz("Who can join?","Anyone who wants a supportive space to practice speaking. If you are not sure whether it is a fit, email us and we will help you decide.")
B.FC=new A.kz("What happens during a typical session?","Sessions focus on practice, reflection, and constructive feedback in a supportive environment. We will walk you through the flow before you join.")
B.FD=new A.kz("Can I talk to you before joining a session?","Yes. We offer a free online explanation session so you can talk with a host, understand what we do, and ask questions. There is no speaking required and no pressure to join.")
B.JE=s([B.FH,B.FE,B.FF,B.FG,B.FC,B.FD],A.aj("z<kz>"))
